QModBus can be easily built using Qt6 qmake:

mkdir build
cd build
qmake6 ..
make

and that's it. Alternatively open the project with Qt Creator and build
it with the according tool buttons.

On distributions where the Qt6 qmake binary isn't on PATH as "qmake6"
(e.g. it's just "qmake" pointing at Qt6), use that name instead.

Requires the Qt6 base/widgets development packages and the Qt6
SerialPort module (e.g. on openSUSE: qt6-base-devel and
qt6-serialport-devel).

